          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A paid plan gives you web downloads (YouTube, Instagram, Mega…) and more simultaneous downloads. Using the T-Box referral code you get extra days when you buy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con “solo si ya está en caché”, TorBox no agrega lo que tendría que descargar desde cero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With “only if already cached”, TorBox won't add anything it would have to download from scratch."
