        }
      }
    },
    "TorBox envía un aviso a ntfy apenas termina algo, aunque T-Box esté cerrada. Instala la app gratuita ntfy y suscríbete al tema que aparece aquí. El tema es aleatorio: quien no lo conozca no ve tus avisos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TorBox sends an alert to ntfy as soon as something finishes, even with T-Box closed. Install the free ntfy app and subscribe to the topic shown here. The topic is random: anyone who doesn't know it can't see your alerts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TorBox no borra lo que está en AirLock en la limpieza de 30 días sin uso. Cuenta para el espacio de AirLock de tu plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TorBox doesn't delete AirLock items in its 30-day inactivity cleanup. It counts toward your plan's AirLock space."
